<title>USA: Best Buy February same store sales down.</title>
<headline>Best Buy February same store sales down.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Best Buy Co Inc said Thursday its same stores sales for February decreased three percent.</p>
<p>Same store sales were off 11 percent for the fourth quarter and declined five percent for the fiscal year ended March 1.</p>
<p>Best Buy said it operates 272 locations, 247 of which were part of its same-store calculations for February.</p>
<p>Best Buy said it plans to open 14 new stores in the coming fiscal year.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
